      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我來說說\n這次的推理小說的大綱吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C62114F868AAA8AAA000A90196B21768463A874065C0F8AAA768459277DB15427300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "舞台是坐落在卡洛斯地區深山中的\n大富豪<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>的宅邸。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "821E53F0662F5750843D572853616D1B65AF573053406DF15C714E2D7684000A59275BCC8C6A001000020102000276845B8590B8300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是關於應邀來到此地的3個來賓\n以及1個秘寶的故事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F95DC65BC61C990804F8652306B64573076840033500B4F868CD3000A4EE553CA0031500B79D85BF6768465454E8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "受到招待的有正作為訓練家活躍的\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D7523062DB5F85768467096B634F5C70BA8A137DF45BB66D3B8E8D7684000A00100002010200032026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪的前任伴侶<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>，\n以及寶石收藏家<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A7684524D4EFB4F344FB60010000201020004FF0C000A4EE553CA5BF677F3653685CF5BB60010000201020005300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而服侍大富豪的管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>，\n將會負責接待這些來賓。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C670D4F8D59275BCC8C6A76847BA15BB600100002018B0001FF0C000A5C0767038CA08CAC63A55F8590194E9B4F868CD3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪首先會\n邀請來賓來到某個房間。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A999651486703000A90808ACB4F868CD34F86523067D0500B623F9593300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個房間本身就是個大金庫，\n即使是使出招式「憤怒之拳」<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也不可能破壞它。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這些都會由管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>來說明。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B623F9593672C8EAB5C31662F500B592791D15EABFF0C000A53734F7F662F4F7F51FA62DB5F0F300C61A460124E4B62F3300D00100001BE00000A4E5F4E0D53EF80FD783458DE5B83300200100001BE00000A90194E9B90FD670375317BA15BB600100002018B00014F868AAA660E300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而房間中央則展示著被稱為\n「<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>之淚」的寶石。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C623F95934E2D592E52475C55793A845788AB7A3170BA000A300C00100002010200064E4B6DDA300D76845BF677F3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這寶石據說是曾被獻上給\n當時的國王AZ的夢幻秘寶。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n大富豪每天早晚都會欣賞它一番，\n以此養精蓄銳。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195BF677F364DA8AAA662F66FE88AB737B4E0A7D66000A757666427684570B738B0041005A768459225E7B79D85BF6300200100001BE01000A59275BCC8C6A6BCF592965E9665A90FD67036B238CDE5B834E00756AFF0C000A4EE56B64990A7CBE84C492B3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隔天早上……大富豪<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>的怒吼\n響徹了整棟宅邸。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9694592965E94E0A2026202659275BCC8C6A001000020102000276846012543C000A97FF5FB94E86657468DF5B8590B8300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來賓們聚集在展示寶石的房間前，\n而大富豪對著他們大喊道：<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n「寶石被偷啦！」<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F868CD35011805A96C657285C55793A5BF677F37684623F9593524DFF0C000A800C59275BCC8C6A5C0D84574ED650115927558A9053FF1A00100001BE00000A300C5BF677F388AB50775566FF01300D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "犯人一定是管家之外的應邀之客。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72AF4EBA4E005B9A662F7BA15BB64E4B5916768461C990804E4B5BA2300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被當成嫌犯的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>問道：\n為什麼管家就一定是清白的呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB757662105ACC72AF76840010000201020004554F9053FF1A000A70BA4EC09EBC7BA15BB65C314E005B9A662F6E05767D76845462FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來是大富豪和管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\n昨天徹夜玩卡牌，因此管家有不在場證明。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F86662F59275BCC8C6A548C7BA15BB600100002018B0001000A662859295FB9591C73A95361724CFF0C56E06B647BA15BB667094E0D572858348B49660E300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被懷疑的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>與<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>\n表示要搜身或搜行李，都沒問題。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB61F775917684001000020102000382070010000201020005000A8868793A8981641C8EAB6216641C884C674EFF0C90FD6C92554F984C300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是管家徹查了一遍，\n但只找到訓練家<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>攜帶的球，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n寶石仍舊是不見蹤影……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F7BA15BB65FB967E54E864E00904DFF0C000A4F4653EA627E52308A137DF45BB60010000201020003651C5E3676847403FF0C00100001BE00000A5BF677F34ECD820A662F4E0D898B8E645F712026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這時候，我就要問<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道是誰偷了\n寶石「<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>之淚」嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901966425019FF0C62115C318981554F00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053662F8AB050774E86000A5BF677F3300C00100002010200064E4B6DDA300D55CEFF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯～嗯～嗯～\n這詭計也許太難了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF5E55EFFF5E55EFFF5E000A90198A6D8A084E5F8A31592A96E34E86300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇呼～！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳果然不簡單。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7547CFF5EFF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3679C71364E0D7C2155AE300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把寶可夢從球放出來到房間裡，\n讓牠趁著四下無人時偷寶石。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n然後當大家被叫到現場時，\n再偷偷地讓寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n回到精靈球裡就對了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A5BF653EF59225F9E7403653E51FA4F865230623F959388E1FF0C000A8B9372608D81845756DB4E0B71214EBA664250775BF677F3300200100001BE01000A71365F8C757659275BB688AB53EB523073FE58346642FF0C000A518D5077507757308B935BF653EF592200100001BE00000A56DE52307CBE9748740388E15C315C0D4E86FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？\n這詭計既大膽又縝密吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F000A90198A6D8A0865E2592781BD53C87E1D5BC65427300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是傑作啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F50914F5C554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會穿幫吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67037A7F5E6B5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這叫做意想不到的盲點。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901953EB505A610F60F34E0D5230768476F29EDE300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我之所以能完成作品，\n一切都要感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不遺餘力的協助！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E4B62404EE580FD5B8C62104F5C54C1FF0C000A4E00520790FD8981611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D907A9918529B7684535452A9FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作為謝禮，只要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓我看看寶可夢，\n我就會把我的傑作裡的角色換成牠們，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然後說故事給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 4588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C70BA8B1D79AEFF0C53EA898100100003110000FF01014F6059B38B936211770B770B5BF653EF5922FF0C000A62115C316703628A6211768450914F5C88E1768489D2827263DB621072605011FF0C00100001BE00000A71365F8C8AAA65454E8B7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3807DFF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    }
  ],
